{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52627","headline":"五言过栖岩寺 · 姚崇","name":"五言过栖岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹫岭高不极，延睇俯何宫？\n城郭千年在，烟云万里通。\n坐忘荣与利，行悟□将□（当爲「空」字）。\n愿假慈悲力，微资燮理功。\n（见清胡聘之《山右石刻丛编》卷五）（按：此诗原刻高宗诗後。\n题下署：「凤阁侍郎同凤阁鸾台平章事姚元崇。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚崇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}